                                "sense_id": "6d1310e5-bfe9-3695-b8cb-0c73aa25795c",
                                "text": "He succeeded admirably in drawing fire away from the troop transports.",
                                "translation": "他成功將火力從運兵車上引開，這令人欽佩。"
                            },
                            {
